<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, marginBottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
      技术架构：模块化单体的四层
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
    {[
      { n: '前端', t: 'React 18 + Vite + Tailwind', d: '登录 / 大厅 / 发单 / 订单详情，共 4 页', c: '#2563EB', w: '88%' },
      { n: 'API 层', t: 'FastAPI + JWT', d: 'auth / orders / pois 三类路由，统一响应信封', c: '#2563EB', w: '94%' },
      { n: '领域层', t: 'OrderService + 状态机内核', d: '17 条迁移 + 19 个动作，apply() 单一写出口', c: '#F59E0B', w: '100%' },
      { n: '数据层', t: 'PostgreSQL + Redis', d: '14 张表 / 27 索引；Redis Lua 抢单锁 + 频控 + GEO', c: '#06B6D4', w: '88%' },
    ].map((l, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 90, alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{l.n}</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: l.w, background: '#F8FAFC', border: `1px solid ${l.c}`, borderLeftWidth: 4, borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 240 }}>{l.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>{l.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>
      单一代码库、按模块分层，避免微服务的复杂度——对一个校园场景，这比拆服务更务实。
    </Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
